        <activityName xml:lang="en">Storage array, at data center</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Storage array, at data center
The storage array contains both HDD and SSD storage devices. The proportion of storage arrays is taken from literature; UUID: 292f6de5-3243-319a-b332-17da8964a09d
The dataset is based on an average of two data centres in Germany. The storage arrays has two types of drives: HDD and SSD types.
Location: Typical storage arrays found in data centers.
Technology: Hard disk drive (HDD) and solid state drive (SSD) are considered in the storage array.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_292f6de5-3243-319a-b332-17da8964a09d.xml</text>
